<title>AUSTRALIA: Hugh Morgan reappointed to Australia's RBA board.</title>
<headline>Hugh Morgan reappointed to Australia's RBA board.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government said on Friday that it had reappointed businessman Hugh Morgan as a member of the Reserve Bank of Australia board for a term of five years.</p>
<p>The government said the reappointment was effective from July 29.</p>
<p>Morgan, the executive director of mining house WMC Ltd , was first appointed to the central bank board in August last year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
